# Normalize line endings. PowerShell + web assets use LF in the repo.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries, declared explicitly so no image depends on git's content sniffing.
# *.mp4 is here before any MP4 is: docs/img/README.md gives it as the fallback
# format for the viewer capture, and that file must not arrive undeclared.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
